{'symbol': 'MAS', 'date': '2021-02-16 08:00:00', 'title': 'MASCO CORPORATION LAUNCHES $50 MILLION VENTURE CAPITAL FUND', 'text': "LIVONIA, MICH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--MASCO CORPORATION (NYSE: MAS), A FORTUNE 500 COMPANY AND A LEADER IN THE DESIGN, MANUFACTURE AND DISTRIBUTION OF BRANDED HOME IMPROVEMENT AND BUILDING PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ESTABLISHMENT OF MASCO VENTURES, WHICH WILL INVEST IN COMPANIES THAT ADVANCE MASCO'S COMMITMENT TO INNOVATION. MASCO VENTURES, A FULLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF MASCO CORPORATION, IS A $50 MILLION VENTURE CAPITAL FUND FOCUSED ON STARTUPS THAT ARE STRATEGICALLY RELEVANT TO MASCO'S INDUSTRY-L"}